# The result store never belongs in git. It is machine-specific, it is
# regenerated by re-running the sweeps, and it grows without bound as runs
# accumulate. `run.R` writes it outside the package tree by default
# (see NV_SWEEP_STORE in README.md); these patterns only catch the case where
# someone deliberately points it in here.
store/
_store/
*.parquet

# Rendered reports and scratch output
*.html
*_files/
.Rhistory
.DS_Store
